{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sports Journalist","role":"Sports Journalist","summary":"A Sports Journalist researches, reports, analyses and communicates sports events, athletes, teams, competitions and broader sports-industry developments through digital media, newspapers, television, radio, podcasts and social platforms.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Sports Journalist researches, reports, analyses and communicates sports events, athletes, teams, competitions and broader sports-industry developments through digital media, newspapers, television, radio, podcasts and social platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Sports Studies / Physical Education gives the student an advantage in understanding:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports rules"},{"text":"Training and performance"},{"text":"Sports psychology"},{"text":"Sports administration"},{"text":"Sporting events"},{"text":"Athlete development"},{"text":"Sports culture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, sports knowledge alone does not make someone a journalist. The student must develop strong reporting, interviewing, writing, verification, multimedia production, data analysis and digital-media skills."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest modern profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sports Knowledge","Journalism","Digital Media","Data","Storytelling"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Sports & Journalism Foundation"},{"text":"BA + reporting + writing + portfolio + sports-media internships"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Professional Reporting"},{"text":"Sports Reporter, Sports Writer, Digital Sports Journalist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Specialist Journalism"},{"text":"Senior Sports Journalist, Sports Analyst, Investigative Sports Reporter"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Editorial & Media Leadership"},{"text":"Sports Editor, Senior Correspondent, Editorial Lead, Sports Media Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop seven core capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Sports knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Build deep understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cricket"},{"text":"Football"},{"text":"Athletics"},{"text":"Tennis"},{"text":"Basketball"},{"text":"Volleyball"},{"text":"Olympics"},{"text":"Indian sports"},{"text":"International sports"},{"text":"Sports governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally develop one or two specialist sports rather than attempting to become an expert in everything immediately."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Investigative journalism"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"Editorial judgment"},{"text":"Headline writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Digital journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Website publishing"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Mobile journalism"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Live blogging"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Newsletters"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Multimedia"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Video shooting"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Audio recording"},{"text":"Podcast production"},{"text":"Graphics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Sports data"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Scorecards"},{"text":"Performance metrics"},{"text":"Player statistics"},{"text":"Match analysis"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python/SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Interviewing"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to interview:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Athletes"},{"text":"Coaches"},{"text":"Officials"},{"text":"Analysts"},{"text":"Administrators"},{"text":"Fans"},{"text":"Sports-business professionals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Ethics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Defamation"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Conflicts of interest"},{"text":"Source protection"},{"text":"Responsible reporting"},{"text":"Sports integrity"}]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Sports & Journalism Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic focus"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports history"},{"text":"Sports sociology"},{"text":"Physical education"},{"text":"Sports administration"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Journalism fundamentals"},{"text":"Media studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Match reports"},{"text":"News stories"},{"text":"Athlete profiles"},{"text":"Opinion columns"},{"text":"Event previews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Publish or archive at least:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"10 match reports"},{"text":"5 athlete profiles"},{"text":"5 sports news stories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Reporting & Digital Media"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports journalism"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Sports communication"},{"text":"Media ethics"},{"text":"Digital journalism"},{"text":"Sports statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"WordPress/CMS"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Photoshop basics"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Audio editing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Start:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Statistics","Power BI","SQL/Python basics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Cover:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"College sports"},{"text":"Local competitions"},{"text":"Tournaments"},{"text":"Sports events"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not wait for a major league assignment to begin building reporting experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Sports Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investigative reporting"},{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"Long-form features"},{"text":"Sports business reporting"},{"text":"Sports policy"},{"text":"Sports governance"},{"text":"Athlete interviews"},{"text":"Multimedia journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital presence"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a professional portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Written articles"},{"text":"Videos"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Data visualisations"},{"text":"Match analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cricket"},{"text":"Football"},{"text":"Olympics/athletics"},{"text":"Tennis"},{"text":"Sports business"},{"text":"Sports policy"},{"text":"Sports science"},{"text":"Sports data"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Sports Data Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse player/team performance using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python or SQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data story"},{"text":"Visualisations"},{"text":"Written analysis"},{"text":"Interactive dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Investigative Sports Story"},{"type":"p","text":"Research a topic such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grassroots sports"},{"text":"Sports infrastructure"},{"text":"Athlete development"},{"text":"Gender participation"},{"text":"Sports funding"},{"text":"Youth sports"}]},{"type":"