"Path 5 — Sports Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","Sports Analytics/Data Science","Sports Analyst/Data Journalist"]},{"type":"p","text":"Best suited to students who enjoy statistics and technology."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"BA"},{"text":"Sports Journalism Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Sports Reporter / Junior Writer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Sports Journalist / Correspondent"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Sports Journalist"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Sports Editor / Senior Correspondent"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Sports Editor-in-Chief / Editorial Director / Media Consultant"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly useful in sports journalism."},{"type":"p","text":"Applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated match summaries"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Interview transcription"},{"text":"Research assistance"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Personalised content"},{"text":"Video clipping"},{"text":"Sports-data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Human value remains important"},{"type":"p","text":"Journalists still provide:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Original reporting"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Context"},{"text":"Verification"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Editorial judgment"},{"text":"Human stories"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated statistics or summaries should always be verified against authoritative match and competition data before publication."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Technology Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"flow","items":["WordPress/CMS","Excel","Canva","Social Platforms"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Media"},{"type":"flow","items":["Premiere Pro/DaVinci Resolve","Audacity/Adobe Audition","Camera/Phone Production"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["Power BI","SQL","Python","Statistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sports APIs","Data Visualisation","AI/NLP","Automated Research Workflows"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Journalism Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"20+ match reports"},{"text":"10 athlete interviews"},{"text":"5 feature stories"},{"text":"2 investigative projects"},{"text":"1 sports-data journalism project"},{"text":"1 podcast series"},{"text":"1 short sports documentary"},{"text":"1 Power BI sports dashboard"},{"text":"Professional sports-writing portfolio"},{"text":"At least one meaningful media internship"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For journalism, published work and reporting experience often demonstrate capability more effectively than certificates alone."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"BA"},{"text":"Sports Media Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Sports Reporter / Writer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Sports Journalist"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Sports Journalist / Correspondent"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Sports Editor"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Editorial Director / Sports Media Consultant"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Sports knowledge + journalism fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Reporting + interviews + digital media"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Data journalism + multimedia + internship"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Strong published portfolio + sports-media experience"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Sports Reporter / Junior Journalist"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Sports Journalist / Correspondent"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Senior Sports Journalist"}],[{"text":"8–12 Years"},{"text":"Sports Editor"}],[{"text":"12+ Years"},{"text":"Editorial Director / Sports Media Consultant"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sports Studies","Journalism","Reporting","Sports Statistics","Interviewing","Fact-Checking","Digital Media","Video","Podcasting","SEO","Excel","Power BI","Data Journalism","Social Media","Sports Analytics","AI-Assisted Research"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree, the strongest positioning is a multimedia sports journalist with data-analysis capability. Sports Studies/Physical Education gives the student genuine understanding of sport, but the career becomes viable through reporting practice, interviews, published stories, digital production and journalistic ethics. Adding sports statistics, Power BI, SQL/Python and data journalism can differentiate the graduate from conventional sports-content writers and create opportunities in modern sports media, analytics companies, leagues and digital sports platforms."}]}]}